  unitName: Goddess Llewxam (EU)
  unitId: 750135
  unitNumber: 7056
  description: When Llewxam felt that a portal was opening, she saw a glimpse of
    all possible futures. She used all her mighty powers, almost dying in the process
    to fuse with the portal to redirect it to her Dark mirror world, aiming at sagraV's
    palace. Thanks to her, the summoners were able to directly strike him. After
    some time of recovery, she is now awakening to the godly powers she earned baking
    in the portal between worlds.
  summonDesc: I feel your call; I have glimpses of futures.
  fusionDesc: The power needed to save entire worlds will be in our hands
  evoDesc: I filled the void, I fused with a portal. Now between worlds I have glimpses
    of the future.
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
